# Primary Adaptations

## Ab Wheel

Best for:

- Anti-extension
- Anterior core strength
- Trunk stiffness

---

## Pallof Press

Best for:

- Anti-rotation
- Punching stability
- Rotational control

---

## Dead Bug

Best for:

- Motor control
- Rehabilitation
- Beginners

---

## Hollow Body Hold

Best for:

- Gymnastics foundation
- Body tension
- Static trunk endurance

---

## Hanging Leg Raise

Best for:

- Dynamic trunk strength
- Hip flexor integration
- Combat-specific hanging strength

---

## Dragon Flag

Best for:

- Elite anterior-chain strength
- Body control
- High-level trunk development

---

## Farmer Carry

Best for:

- Whole-body stability
- Grip integration
- Trunk endurance

---

## Suitcase Carry

Best for:

- Anti-lateral flexion
- Anti-rotation
- Asymmetrical trunk strength

---

## Overhead Carry

Best for:

- Shoulder stability
- Trunk stiffness
- Overhead robustness

