# CAS Decision Rules

Prefer Ab Wheel when maximal trunk stiffness is required.

Prefer Pallof Press when rotational stability is the priority.

Prefer Dead Bug during rehabilitation or movement re-education.

Prefer Dragon Flag only when sufficient trunk strength already exists.

Prefer Carries when whole-body integration is desired.

---

# Final Principle

No core exercise is universally superior.

The optimal exercise is the one that develops the adaptation most relevant to the athlete's current objective while maximizing transfer and minimizing unnecessary fatigue.

This comparison enables CAS to make that decision objectively.